WEBVTT

00:00:42.520 --> 00:00:48.860
mabushii hizashi wo se ni hashiridasu machi no naka

00:00:42.520 --> 00:00:48.860
眩しい 陽差しを背に 走り出す街の中

00:00:42.520 --> 00:00:48.860
Starting my run in the middle of town, bright sunlight at my back

00:00:49.270 --> 00:00:55.320
tatakareta itsumo no youni kata wo

00:00:49.270 --> 00:00:55.320
たたかれた いつものように肩を

00:00:49.270 --> 00:00:55.320
as always, you tapped my shoulder

00:00:56.030 --> 00:01:02.120
kimi ni muchuu na koto ni wake nante nai noni

00:00:56.030 --> 00:01:02.120
君に夢中なことに 理由なんてないのに

00:00:56.030 --> 00:01:02.120
I'm so enthralled by you, yet for reasons unknown

00:01:02.790 --> 00:01:07.790
sono ude wa karamu koto wa nai

00:01:02.790 --> 00:01:07.790
その腕は 絡むことはない

00:01:02.790 --> 00:01:07.790
your arm won't be linked to mine.

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:11.050
itsuno ma ni ka hitomi

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:11.050
いつの間にか瞳

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:11.050
I don't know when but my eyes were locked on you,

00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:14.380
ubawarete hajimatta

00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:14.380
奪われて始まった

00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:14.380
and that's how it all began.

00:01:14.840 --> 00:01:20.890
hanasanai yuruganai Crazy for You

00:01:14.840 --> 00:01:20.890
離さない 揺れるがない Crazy for You

00:01:14.840 --> 00:01:20.890
I won't let you go. I won't have any doubts. Crazy for You.

00:01:21.390 --> 00:01:28.020
kimi ga suki da to sakebitai ashita wo kaete miyou

00:01:21.390 --> 00:01:28.020
君が好きだと 叫びたい 明日を変えてみよう

00:01:21.390 --> 00:01:28.020
I want to shout that I love you, let's try to change tomorrow,

00:01:28.400 --> 00:01:34.650
kooritsuiteku toki wo buchi kowa shitai

00:01:28.400 --> 00:01:34.650
凍りついてく時間を ぶち壊したい

00:01:28.400 --> 00:01:34.650
I want to put an end to the times I couldn't speak.

00:01:34.900 --> 00:01:41.910
kimi ga suki da to sakebitai yuuki de fumidasou

00:01:34.900 --> 00:01:41.910
君が好きだと叫びたい 勇気で踏み出そう

00:01:34.900 --> 00:01:41.910
I want to shout that I love you. Let's be brave and take a step forward.

00:01:42.330 --> 00:01:49.500
kono atsui omoi wo uketomete hoshii

00:01:42.330 --> 00:01:49.500
この熱い想いを 受け止めてほしい

00:01:42.330 --> 00:01:49.500
These burning feelings, I want you to catch.

00:02:07.480 --> 00:02:08.100
Sakuragi,

00:02:08.690 --> 00:02:10.480
Let me show you what real basketball is.

00:02:10.770 --> 00:02:11.400
Shut up,

00:02:11.770 --> 00:02:13.780
I won't let you go any further.

00:02:16.780 --> 00:02:17.400
Damn!

00:02:25.290 --> 00:02:28.290
Number 10 holding offense. Basket counts. One free throw.

00:02:39.380 --> 00:02:41.680
See Sakuragi, that's what a real shot is.

00:02:42.050 --> 00:02:42.890
Damn!

00:02:48.640 --> 00:02:50.600
One hour earlier

00:02:50.600 --> 00:02:54.520
Takezono High School

00:03:09.290 --> 00:03:11.120
Haruko, their cheering is pretty loud.

00:03:12.210 --> 00:03:13.330
Hmm, but we have to cheer too...

00:03:13.670 --> 00:03:16.590
Look, they seem try to do their best!

00:03:17.170 --> 00:03:21.300
Rukawa! Let's Go Rukawa! Rukawa!

00:03:22.180 --> 00:03:24.470
What are they up to?

00:03:26.180 --> 00:03:30.770
Rukawa! Lovely Rukawa! Rukawaa...

00:03:31.390 --> 00:03:33.520
Even Rukawa's cheerleaders aren't a match.

00:03:35.110 --> 00:03:41.900
Takezono! Fight! Fight! Fight!

00:03:42.990 --> 00:03:44.450
I got a wind of it,

00:03:44.530 --> 00:03:46.490
but Takezono fans' cheering is really good.

00:03:46.530 --> 00:03:50.120
This is why other schools are not willing to play against Takezono.

00:03:50.370 --> 00:03:52.870
Under such great pressure, all morale is lost.

00:03:53.370 --> 00:03:55.290
Since 70% of Takezono's students are girls.

00:03:55.670 --> 00:03:58.300
Thus, basketball team members are very popular among them.

00:03:59.050 --> 00:04:02.130
They're just a bunch of guys who are mesmerized by girls.

00:04:02.590 --> 00:04:04.300
Defeating them will be easy.

00:04:05.470 --> 00:04:08.260
Let me, the genius Sakuragi Hanamichi, teach them a lesson.

00:04:10.430 --> 00:04:13.560
Ddin't you join the basketball team because of Haruko-chan?

00:04:13.900 --> 00:04:14.600
Speaking of which,

00:04:14.690 --> 00:04:17.190
I wonder if Haruko-san is cheering for me.

00:04:20.490 --> 00:04:21.280
Gori...

00:04:21.440 --> 00:04:23.030
Listen up, everyone.

00:04:23.610 --> 00:04:24.950
That annoying cheering,

00:04:25.240 --> 00:04:28.450
Is one of Takezono's secret weapons in securing best eight position of the regionals.

00:04:29.490 --> 00:04:33.920
There are many girls constantly watching Takezono basketball team's practice.

00:04:34.170 --> 00:04:37.000
So in order not to screw themselves up, they practice very hard.

00:04:37.590 --> 00:04:39.880
Thus, Takezono is not just a team of idols.

00:04:40.380 --> 00:04:42.220
Keep that in mind, understand?!

00:04:42.380 --> 00:04:43.090
Yeah!

00:04:43.670 --> 00:04:45.380
Let me take care of them!

00:04:48.300 --> 00:04:50.520
Hey Sakuragi! The Court's over here.

00:04:50.770 --> 00:04:52.680
I... I need to go to the toilet for a little while.

00:04:52.930 --> 00:04:55.190
My stomach has been aching since morning.

00:04:55.770 --> 00:04:57.730
Idiot! Be quick!

00:05:01.570 --> 00:05:03.400
He seems very nervous.

00:05:03.740 --> 00:05:04.570
A real retard.

00:05:06.700 --> 00:05:09.620
Damn! I should have taken the entrance exams for Takezono.

00:05:09.910 --> 00:05:11.790
It's like an all-girl school.

00:05:12.080 --> 00:05:14.870
This school has to be men's paradise.

00:05:15.160 --> 00:05:18.080
Stupid! Not everyone can be popular with girls.

00:05:18.290 --> 00:05:19.790
Especially not you.

00:05:20.090 --> 00:05:21.590
What do you mean by that?!

00:05:21.880 --> 00:05:24.300
But, this is Hanamichi's second match.

00:05:24.510 --> 00:05:26.430
I hope he has improved.

00:05:26.680 --> 00:05:28.090
Ok! Let's make a bet on that.

00:05:28.390 --> 00:05:30.970
Who wants to bet on Hanamichi having no progress at all?

00:05:31.060 --> 00:05:31.890
Me!

00:05:32.470 --> 00:05:33.680
There can be no bet then.

00:05:35.980 --> 00:05:37.900
Damn, that stupid Gori.

00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:39.980
Hitting people for no reason.

00:05:40.230 --> 00:05:41.150
Such an unreasonable guy.

00:05:41.480 --> 00:05:43.570
No matter how you look at it, he can't be Haruko's brother.

00:05:45.280 --> 00:05:46.700
Nyoga-san, do your best!

00:05:46.700 --> 00:05:47.280
Thank you.

00:05:47.990 --> 00:05:50.780
Blah. It's those loud mouth girls again!

00:05:51.990 --> 00:05:54.370
I can sense this girl is very classy.

00:05:59.920 --> 00:06:03.090
I didn't know I had fans here in Takezono,

00:06:03.300 --> 00:06:04.960
even bringing me drinks.

00:06:06.970 --> 00:06:09.300
Lady, you have very good taste.

00:06:13.680 --> 00:06:14.770
Sakuragi-kun.

00:06:17.810 --> 00:06:19.600
Sorry, Sakuragi-kun.

00:06:19.900 --> 00:06:22.520
But, I like Oda-kun from the basketball team.

00:06:22.570 --> 00:06:25.070
I failed!

00:06:25.280 --> 00:06:26.610
Congratulations Hanamichi.

00:06:26.690 --> 00:06:29.490
In your three years of Junior High, you've gotten rejected by 50 girls.

00:06:29.570 --> 00:06:32.200
That will be a very hard record to break.

00:06:32.620 --> 00:06:33.780
Damn you bastards!

00:06:42.920 --> 00:06:44.880
Yo... Yohko-san.

00:06:47.630 --> 00:06:51.090
A... Are you doing well?

00:06:51.390 --> 00:06:52.640
Y... Yes.

00:06:53.140 --> 00:06:54.180
Is that so?

00:06:54.600 --> 00:06:56.770
Sakuragi-kun, this uniform on you...

00:06:57.430 --> 00:06:59.600
This? Does it have a weird odor?

00:06:59.980 --> 00:07:03.560
That must be it. I haven't really washed this yet.

00:07:06.280 --> 00:07:08.490
I heard you got into Shohoku,

00:07:08.780 --> 00:07:11.070
but I didn't know that you joined the basketball team.

00:07:13.410 --> 00:07:14.780
Because I'm a sportsman.

00:07:14.950 --> 00:07:18.290
I never knew you were good at Basketball.

00:07:19.370 --> 00:07:21.870
I was just hiding my skills.

00:07:22.170 --> 00:07:25.380
But, I've already defeated Captain Gori.

00:07:25.670 --> 00:07:27.380
And I am slated to be the next captain.

00:07:27.510 --> 00:07:28.090
Gori?

00:07:28.460 --> 00:07:30.590
He looks like a gorilla, thus his nickname is Gori.

00:07:41.270 --> 00:07:41.810
Oda?

00:07:44.400 --> 00:07:46.020
But, it's hard to believe,

00:07:46.110 --> 00:07:48.230
Compared to your Junior High times, you're a different person.

00:07:48.360 --> 00:07:49.900
Because I'm a genius!

00:07:50.820 --> 00:07:52.860
Only your hair color hasn't changed.

00:07:52.910 --> 00:07:53.700
Is that so?

00:07:55.870 --> 00:07:59.000
Yohko-san is much prettier than she was in Junior High.

00:07:59.370 --> 00:08:01.370
I didn't know she got into Takezono.

00:08:10.920 --> 00:08:11.840
I didn't know

00:08:12.380 --> 00:08:14.090
that you guys were that close.

00:08:14.390 --> 00:08:15.140
Oda-kun...

00:08:15.720 --> 00:08:16.680
Oda?

00:08:17.140 --> 00:08:20.390
Sakuragi, stop kidding around. That uniform...

00:08:21.350 --> 00:08:23.140
Oda-kun is surprised too right?

00:08:23.390 --> 00:08:26.360
Sakuragi is in Shohoku's basketball team now.

00:08:26.440 --> 00:08:27.230
That's nothing...

00:08:27.900 --> 00:08:29.190
I'm not surprised.

00:08:29.690 --> 00:08:30.860
I'm just worried for his team.

00:08:32.780 --> 00:08:33.780
Isn't that right?

00:08:34.280 --> 00:08:35.700
What do you know about basketball?

00:08:35.990 --> 00:08:39.290
You only keep fighting in Junior High everyday.

00:08:39.740 --> 00:08:41.160
Shohoku must be running short on people.

00:08:41.450 --> 00:08:44.370
Idiot, geniuses don't need any experience.

00:08:44.710 --> 00:08:47.330
If you had seen my great display against Ryonan,

00:08:47.420 --> 00:08:49.170
then you'd understand.

00:08:51.300 --> 00:08:52.300
Don't look down on basketball.

00:08:52.420 --> 00:08:53.050
What?

00:08:53.470 --> 00:08:54.300
Sakuragi!

00:08:54.800 --> 00:08:57.470
Punks like you have no right to play basketball.

00:08:57.800 --> 00:08:59.970
There's a limit even if you want to disgrace basketball!

00:09:00.560 --> 00:09:02.180
You damn cocky bastard!

00:09:03.890 --> 00:09:04.890
Sakuragi-kun!

00:09:05.480 --> 00:09:06.480
Just as I thought,

00:09:06.900 --> 00:09:09.110
you're still the same, using violence to solve everything.

00:09:14.240 --> 00:09:19.700
Sakuragi, hit me all you want,

00:09:20.490 --> 00:09:22.790
but from now on, don't touch basketball again!

00:09:23.200 --> 00:09:25.790
Stop insulting the great basketball spirit!

00:09:26.580 --> 00:09:29.880
Damn it! You stupid punk!

00:09:29.920 --> 00:09:30.960
Sakuragi-kun!

00:09:37.590 --> 00:09:39.050
Hit me if you want you punk!

00:09:39.300 --> 00:09:40.180
Damn you!

00:09:40.390 --> 00:09:41.810
Stop it, Sakuragi-kun!

00:09:42.310 --> 00:09:43.430
Don't look down on basketball...

00:09:57.280 --> 00:09:58.360
Damn!

00:10:16.380 --> 00:10:17.090
Sakuragi,

00:10:17.590 --> 00:10:20.470
soon, you'll see! I'll show you what real basketball is!

00:10:22.890 --> 00:10:23.600
Oda-kun!

00:10:41.490 --> 00:10:44.200
Hey did you hear? Oda-kun almost got hit.

00:10:44.290 --> 00:10:45.240
Oda-kun?

00:10:45.330 --> 00:10:46.700
How cruel!

00:10:46.830 --> 00:10:49.080
I think it was Shohoku's number 10.

00:10:49.170 --> 00:10:51.710
That's unforgivable, to bully Oda-kun. We can't forgive him!

00:10:52.080 --> 00:10:54.460
He must be one of Shohoku's punks.

00:10:54.460 --> 00:10:56.800
You can tell by the red hair.

00:10:57.460 --> 00:10:59.680
So cruel, I feel sorry for Oda-kun.

00:10:59.720 --> 00:11:01.800
I think that guy's name is Sakuragi.

00:11:03.890 --> 00:11:06.270
Rukawa-kun! Do your best!

00:11:06.810 --> 00:11:09.390
Hanamichi-san! Do your best!

00:11:09.690 --> 00:11:14.520
Stupid number 10! Don't pick on Oda!

00:11:14.570 --> 00:11:16.400
Number 10 go home!

00:11:16.400 --> 00:11:30.500
Go home... Go home... Go home...

00:11:30.580 --> 00:11:32.830
You have guts, Oda!

00:11:32.920 --> 00:11:36.000
Let me see what your basketball is!

00:12:01.200 --> 00:12:02.570
Number 10, traveling!

00:12:03.360 --> 00:12:05.450
Good job number 10, stupid.

00:12:07.870 --> 00:12:09.870
Idiot. In basketball, individualistic play won't let us win.

00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:11.870
Rukawa, you bastard!

00:12:13.080 --> 00:12:14.830
Hanamichi, be more serious.

00:12:15.000 --> 00:12:16.590
Hanamichi's too impulsive.

00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:20.260
Of course he is. They were once opponents in love.

00:12:20.880 --> 00:12:23.470
But the truth is, she turned into a beauty.

00:12:28.760 --> 00:12:31.390
Oda-kun and Sakuragi-kun, do your best.

00:12:37.060 --> 00:12:39.780
Sakuragi, looks like you are not too popular with your teammates.

00:12:39.900 --> 00:12:41.070
What the...

00:12:47.780 --> 00:12:49.870
This is like an adult playing against a kid.

00:12:50.040 --> 00:12:51.370
Definitely being toyed around.

00:12:59.880 --> 00:13:02.210
Oda! Oda! Oda!

00:13:02.630 --> 00:13:05.300
Damn, getting so cocky over one shot.

00:13:19.190 --> 00:13:21.190
Rukawa-kun! Incredible!

00:13:31.370 --> 00:13:32.490
Did you see that, Oda?

00:13:32.950 --> 00:13:36.080
This is genius basketball player Sakuragi Hanamichi's super jump ability.

00:13:38.250 --> 00:13:39.540
Five second violation.

00:13:40.590 --> 00:13:43.380
Stupid Hanamichi, why don't you familiarize yourself with the rules?

00:13:46.720 --> 00:13:49.680
Why is everyone picking on me?

00:13:50.180 --> 00:13:52.470
Sakuragi-kun, do your best!

00:13:53.270 --> 00:13:53.890
Haruko-san!

00:13:54.980 --> 00:13:57.100
Haruko-san, are you cheering for me?

00:13:58.480 --> 00:13:59.980
Please watch, Haruko-san.

00:14:00.480 --> 00:14:04.940
I will prove to you that even 1 million cheers can't compare to one of yours.

00:14:06.490 --> 00:14:07.570
You too Rukawa-kun...

00:14:08.410 --> 00:14:10.370
Haruko's line of sight

00:14:25.300 --> 00:14:26.800
Stupid.

00:14:32.220 --> 00:14:33.680
Thank you for your support.

00:14:34.770 --> 00:14:35.770
1st half over.

00:14:42.060 --> 00:14:44.900
Those cheers are really loud and annoying.

00:14:45.570 --> 00:14:48.700
Their main player, Oda Tatsuma, is very popular with the girls.

00:14:49.240 --> 00:14:51.620
And he has real skills.

00:14:51.870 --> 00:14:52.280
Listen,

00:14:52.780 --> 00:14:54.200
don't mind those loud cheers.

00:14:54.790 --> 00:14:56.580
We have to concentrate on winning the game.

00:14:56.830 --> 00:14:57.250
Yes!

00:14:58.330 --> 00:14:59.330
As long as you concentrate,

00:14:59.670 --> 00:15:01.080
you will not be distracted by other noises.

00:15:02.170 --> 00:15:05.380
Sakuragi, did you just hear the Captain's instructions?

00:15:08.800 --> 00:15:09.380
Oda!

00:15:10.380 --> 00:15:12.180
I'll defeat you!

00:15:33.570 --> 00:15:36.240
Hey Oda. Sakuragi got into another fight again.

00:15:36.580 --> 00:15:38.620
He must have beaten him with his headbutt.

00:15:52.890 --> 00:15:55.100
Great! This is your 125th consecutive win.

00:15:55.390 --> 00:15:57.100
This is our Hanamichi, undefeatable.

00:15:57.180 --> 00:15:58.970
A winner in fights, but a loser in love!

00:16:01.890 --> 00:16:02.310
Oh no!

00:16:06.150 --> 00:16:09.280
When Sakuragi was wasting his time with his friends,

00:16:09.900 --> 00:16:11.700
I was concentrating on basketball practice.

00:16:13.610 --> 00:16:17.490
No matter how hard it was, I kept on practicing.

00:16:22.750 --> 00:16:26.170
Sakuragi, you are now playing on the same court as myself.

00:16:26.630 --> 00:16:27.540
That's absolutely ridiculous!

00:16:29.380 --> 00:16:30.380
Sakuragi!

00:16:30.670 --> 00:16:31.010
Oda!

00:16:31.550 --> 00:16:32.050
Oda!

00:16:32.550 --> 00:16:32.880
Yes!

00:16:33.590 --> 00:16:34.510
What's wrong, Oda?

00:16:35.140 --> 00:16:37.930
You're usually quite calm. Why are you so flustered today?

00:16:38.260 --> 00:16:39.180
Y... yes.

00:16:40.100 --> 00:16:41.980
Everyone can see from the results of the first half,

00:16:42.390 --> 00:16:44.690
that the Shohoku's most dangerous players are Akagi and Rukawa.

00:16:45.190 --> 00:16:47.480
Especially Rukawa, guard him tightly.

00:16:47.980 --> 00:16:49.020
Oda, stop playing with number 10.

00:16:49.400 --> 00:16:50.820
Mark Rukawa tightly.

00:16:50.980 --> 00:16:51.320
Yes!

00:17:19.600 --> 00:17:20.350
Nice shot.

00:17:22.180 --> 00:17:22.890
Let's take a rest.

00:17:28.940 --> 00:17:31.440
I've decided to transfer to Takezono.

00:17:32.570 --> 00:17:34.990
First of all, their basketball team isn't tat bad,

00:17:35.280 --> 00:17:38.660
and secondly, the coach is very sincere in inviting me to their team.

00:17:39.370 --> 00:17:41.080
Is that so? That's good.

00:17:42.700 --> 00:17:46.160
I'll definitely defeat the region's top two teams, Kainan and Ryonan,

00:17:46.580 --> 00:17:48.670
and allow Takezono to take part in the Inter-high Championship.

00:17:49.290 --> 00:17:52.090
I think I can fulfill my dreams with these two hands.

00:17:53.510 --> 00:17:54.380
I think I'll...

00:17:56.300 --> 00:17:58.390
I'll also transfer to Takezono.

00:18:01.390 --> 00:18:02.100
Then it's a deal.

00:18:22.870 --> 00:18:23.490
Yohko...

00:18:37.670 --> 00:18:38.340
Oda-kun.

00:18:40.300 --> 00:18:43.100
You've changed, you're not the way you used to be in Junior High.

00:18:43.760 --> 00:18:44.060
Eh?

00:18:44.850 --> 00:18:46.480
You used to always carry a smile.

00:18:46.890 --> 00:18:49.900
But ever since you've been to High School, the smile has disappeared.

00:18:50.190 --> 00:18:52.230
There is a scary feeling around you...

00:18:53.570 --> 00:18:56.070
You will get infuriated even when your teammates make small mistakes.

00:18:56.280 --> 00:19:00.740
It is starting to show in your face. In Junior High, you weren't like that.

00:19:00.990 --> 00:19:01.870
Of course!

00:19:02.660 --> 00:19:04.870
Because high school basketball isn't a game.

00:19:05.790 --> 00:19:08.000
In order to win, diligent practice is a must!

00:19:08.500 --> 00:19:09.790
That may be right,

00:19:10.290 --> 00:19:12.880
But now, you, Oda-kun, are devoid of happiness.

00:19:13.380 --> 00:19:14.000
What?

00:19:14.290 --> 00:19:15.500
Even though I don't understand that much,

00:19:15.800 --> 00:19:18.880
I feel... I feel as though you're missing something.

00:19:19.680 --> 00:19:20.550
Don't go overboard!

00:19:46.280 --> 00:19:47.120
Yohko...

00:20:04.300 --> 00:20:06.300
Rukawa-kun is awesome!

00:20:08.770 --> 00:20:11.520
To be able to keep his cool amidst such noisy cheers, he is really amazing.

00:20:12.190 --> 00:20:14.770
Either he's too confident, or he's too slow.

00:20:29.330 --> 00:20:30.250
Shohoku ball!

00:20:31.620 --> 00:20:34.170
It is too tough to be running hard after an out ball, Sakuragi.

00:20:35.670 --> 00:20:38.630
So stupid! You must be missing a nerve or something.

00:20:38.800 --> 00:20:40.880
Just be more lively in the game, Sakuragi-kun.

00:20:41.130 --> 00:20:42.470
Of course!

00:20:42.880 --> 00:20:44.180
It's no big deal. Don't mind.

00:20:45.590 --> 00:20:47.260
Your clownish actions are too humiliating.

00:20:47.600 --> 00:20:50.100
Oda, right now my opponent isn't you,

00:20:50.390 --> 00:20:52.100
my opponent is the basketball!

00:20:52.390 --> 00:20:53.100
What?

00:21:01.030 --> 00:21:02.280
Sakuragi, over here!

00:21:03.030 --> 00:21:03.990
Gori!

00:21:18.590 --> 00:21:20.000
This is the crucial juncture!

00:21:20.380 --> 00:21:21.590
Those who last will emerge victorious!

00:21:24.930 --> 00:21:27.300
Yeah, everybody must endure to the end!

00:21:32.470 --> 00:21:33.730
Sakuragi, he's going to take a shot!

00:21:38.560 --> 00:21:40.070
Wh... What is this?

00:21:42.400 --> 00:21:42.980
Damn!

00:21:49.700 --> 00:21:51.450
Foul on number 10, pushing, 2 throws.

00:21:51.990 --> 00:21:53.500
I didn't do anything!

00:21:53.870 --> 00:21:55.290
Oda used his elbow to hit me!

00:21:55.580 --> 00:21:57.790
Sakuragi-kun, don't mind, don't mind!

00:21:59.380 --> 00:21:59.880
Understood.

00:22:04.590 --> 00:22:06.170
What was that defense just now?

00:22:06.590 --> 00:22:08.300
I couldn't even pass him.

00:22:13.680 --> 00:22:15.890
It can't be real... that kind of tight defense...

00:22:15.890 --> 00:22:18.770
Normal people can't achieve that... but just now...

00:22:28.570 --> 00:22:29.070
Pass!

00:22:32.200 --> 00:22:33.080
Ah! Oda!

00:22:38.580 --> 00:22:40.880
Who on earth would pass to the opponent?!

00:22:41.290 --> 00:22:42.090
This one here...

00:22:42.500 --> 00:22:46.210
Sakuragi-kun, what just happened? I wonder why he doesn't pass to Rukawa?

00:22:47.590 --> 00:22:48.720
Seems like she doesn't know.

00:22:48.720 --> 00:22:49.800
Haruko...

00:22:50.970 --> 00:22:52.180
Don't mind, don't mind...

00:23:14.370 --> 00:23:16.200
Oda! Loose ball!

00:25:27.830 --> 00:25:32.880
I didn't expect Takezono's coach to applaud for Sakuragi.

00:25:33.470 --> 00:25:36.090
My team's lack in spirit was displayed by him.

00:25:36.340 --> 00:25:37.930
He taught us a valuable lesson.

00:25:39.800 --> 00:25:44.680
Our team's Oda has very competitive heart to win the Inter-high Championship,

00:25:44.770 --> 00:25:46.640
but he lets his temper get the better of him.

00:25:46.900 --> 00:25:51.230
He forgot the basic principle of basketball, to compete wholeheartedly.

00:25:51.980 --> 00:25:53.990
We learned a valuable lesson today.

00:25:54.280 --> 00:25:55.570
Thank you very much.

00:25:56.200 --> 00:25:59.160
No no. It is us who learned a lesson.

00:25:59.700 --> 00:26:00.870
Thank you.

00:26:01.200 --> 00:26:03.290
Let's work hard to enter the Inter-high Championship together.

00:26:05.460 --> 00:26:06.290
Haruko-san!

00:26:07.370 --> 00:26:08.170
Sakuragi-kun!

00:26:10.170 --> 00:26:12.590
Haruko-san's encouragement lifted my morale.

00:26:12.880 --> 00:26:16.470
Ru... Rukawa-kun... you were very outstanding today.

00:26:16.630 --> 00:26:18.090
Ahh, is that so?

00:26:21.300 --> 00:26:22.470
What should I do?

00:26:25.680 --> 00:26:26.480
Haruko-san!

00:26:27.690 --> 00:26:30.150
Sakuragi's performance was good too.

00:26:30.310 --> 00:26:31.770
Because I'm a genius!

00:26:35.280 --> 00:26:39.700
Sa... Sakuragi-kun... too? too? too?

00:26:40.990 --> 00:26:41.660
Sakuragi!

00:26:42.370 --> 00:26:44.410
Hurry up, or we're leaving without you!

00:26:45.080 --> 00:26:48.920
Bastard! How dare you leave today's game's MVP behind?

00:26:51.000 --> 00:26:54.090
Haruko-san! Don't stand there. Hurry, hurry!

00:27:11.480 --> 00:27:16.480
I love you too... Yohko.

00:27:11.480 --> 00:27:16.480
I love you. Oda.

00:27:13.190 --> 00:27:16.570
Yoko-chan, today, I finally understood what you said that day.

00:27:18.190 --> 00:27:21.610
I have to pursue basketball the way Sakuragi did.

00:27:21.870 --> 00:27:26.290
To really feel the sport, instead of just trying to be in the limelight or winning.

00:27:27.000 --> 00:27:29.290
It will be more meaningful.

00:27:30.080 --> 00:27:32.170
Of course, I'll still try to get into the Inter-high Championship.

00:27:34.380 --> 00:27:35.170
Oda-kun.

00:27:43.180 --> 00:27:47.270
Sakuragi! I'll see you at the Inter-high Championship! Show down!

00:27:52.810 --> 00:27:56.190
anata dake mitsumete 'ru

00:27:52.810 --> 00:27:56.190
あなただけ見つめてる

00:27:52.810 --> 00:27:56.190
I see only you in my eyes...

00:27:56.520 --> 00:28:00.650
deatta hi ka ra imademo zutto

00:27:56.520 --> 00:28:00.650
出会った日から 今でもずっと

00:27:56.520 --> 00:28:00.650
... since the day we met. -now and forever-

