anata sae soba ni ireba

00:28:00.780 --> 00:28:04.240
あなたさえそばにいれば

00:28:00.780 --> 00:28:04.240
As long as you're beside me,

00:28:04.530 --> 00:28:07.830
hoka ni nannimo iranai

00:28:04.530 --> 00:28:07.830
他に何もいらない

00:28:04.530 --> 00:28:07.830
I don't need anything else.

