anata ga sou yorokobu kara

00:28:18.050 --> 00:28:22.180
あなたがそう喜ぶから

00:28:18.050 --> 00:28:22.180
Since it seemed to please you...

00:28:22.550 --> 00:28:25.550
keshou mo mazu yameta wa

00:28:22.550 --> 00:28:25.550
化粧をまず止めたわ

00:28:22.550 --> 00:28:25.550
I decided not to use make-up anymore.

00:28:26.300 --> 00:28:31.810
doko ni itemo tsukumaru you ni pokeberu motto wa

00:28:26.300 --> 00:28:31.810
どこにいても捕まるようにポケベル 持ったわ

00:28:26.300 --> 00:28:31.810
I'm always carrying a pager everywhere I go, so you can find me at anytime.

00:28:32.810 --> 00:28:37.980
kuruma mo kuwashikunatta shi

00:28:32.810 --> 00:28:37.980
車も詳しくなったし

00:28:32.810 --> 00:28:37.980
I know a lot more about cars.

00:28:38.570 --> 00:28:41.650
oryouri mo ganbatteru

00:28:38.570 --> 00:28:41.650
oryouri mo ganbatteru あなただけ見つめてる

00:28:38.570 --> 00:28:41.650
And I'll work on my cooking some more.

00:28:42.610 --> 00:28:51.620
maiyotte iru kedo kono hito ni ishhou tsuite yukou to kimeta

00:28:42.610 --> 00:28:51.620
maiyotte iru kedo kono hito ni ishhou tsuite yukou to kimeta  迷っているけど この人に一生ついて行こうと決めた

00:28:42.610 --> 00:28:51.620
But I'll be with you every night for the rest of my life.

00:28:54.870 --> 00:28:58.340
anata dake mitsumeteru

00:28:54.870 --> 00:28:58.340
あなただけ見つめてる

00:28:54.870 --> 00:28:58.340
I see only you in my eyes.

00:28:58.590 --> 00:29:02.670
hitori de matsu futari dake no heya

00:28:58.590 --> 00:29:02.670
独りで待つ二人だけの部屋

00:28:58.590 --> 00:29:02.670
I'm waiting alone in our room.

00:29:02.880 --> 00:29:09.890
anata no houhouemi wa bara iro no kusari

00:29:02.880 --> 00:29:09.890
あなたの微笑みはバラ色 の鎖

00:29:02.880 --> 00:29:09.890
Your smile is like a rose colored chain.

00:29:11.020 --> 00:29:15.600
yuke!! yume nashi onna!

00:29:11.020 --> 00:29:15.600
